  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252frp-renames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/extra/links/modrinth.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rp-renames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/extra/links/curseforge.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/HiWord9/RPRenames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/extra/links/github.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/3Q699k7qHr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/blob/extra/links/discord.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.me%252fhiword9\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/extra/links/paypal.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HiWord9/RPRenames/extra/links/thx4donation.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"75\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>无需离开 Minecraft，直接在铁砧菜单中查看你资源包中的所有 CIT 和 CEM 重命名！</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>NeoForge：</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>RP Renames 现已支持 NeoForge，可通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forgified-fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forgified Fabric Api</a> 使用。你还需要在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-resewn\" rel=\"nofollow\">CITResewn</a> 旁安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-resewn-neopatcher\" rel=\"nofollow\">CITResewnNeoPatcher</a>，才能在 NeoForge 上使用 CIT 资源包，详情请前往其页面查看。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这是一款客户端模组，可帮助你在资源包中为工具或其他物品搜索合适的自定义方案。它会显示新纹理所需的所有可能名称，你只需点击即可为你的物品赋予全新的外观！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/84eb41c031698153b87e4c63961f72342007a6e7.png\" alt=\"CIT 列表\" width=\"720\" height=\"344\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hvqcuDMT/images/713c175aecc1eaffa7a715bdef732e30c11bcce1.png\" alt=\"预览！\" width=\"720\" height=\"898\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>创造模式标签页！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hvqcuDMT/images/c449b37cc335faeaa049de72f736fac23670c55e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"338\"></p>\n<p>CEM 支持！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hvqcuDMT/images/e0d9636c217069d9af43733828e306a0f4d8d383.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"377\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hvqcuDMT/images/9bb2bceef6b3eb0f255f0fd7308de58bec433e86.png\" alt=\"内置资源包！\" width=\"720\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>全新角色扮演体验！你不再需要在一长串的资源包网站或其他地方的重命名列表中翻找某一个名字，它现在就在你的 Minecraft 中！</p>",
